From 50b1e574e7694be282daf18407dcf2cd6f03ef86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AMB-1 FM6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:18:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] The voices named Voice 1, 2 and 3; which voice and group,
 large at the screen's top on each press

The pad, the bells and the bass are Voice 1, 2 and 3 on the screen, in the help cards, the parameters' names and the
web app; their first group is PATCH. A voice's button says on the header which voice and which group it went to
(screen only: a screen reader still hears the page), so a voice's pages are not taken for another's.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
